27
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.299
no me digas

28
00:00:37.899 --> 00:00:39.200
¿Crees que es rica?

29
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.399
No importa lo rica que sea, en Flower City,

30
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.399
